# Retrieved PDFs: ~320 MB, one file alone is 182 MB.
# Every one is reconstructible from the DOIs and IDs in */MANIFEST.md,
# so the binaries are excluded and the provenance is tracked.
*/pdf/

# Tracked deliberately (do not add to this file):
#   */MANIFEST.md   what was retrieved, with licenses
#   */QUERIES.md    what was searched, incl. zero-hit negative results
#   */queries/      raw API responses  (~1.5 MB total)
#   */meta/         machine-readable records behind the manifests
#   WANTED.md       verified but inaccessible
#   README.md, normalize.sh
